o enter into other transactions that could help achieve other strategic objectives.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":3,\"reason\":\"The excerpt identifies delayed completion, including regulatory approval delays, as risks that may prevent other transactions, hinder retention of critical target talent, and allow technology to evolve and make the acquisition less attractive.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":4,\"reason\":\"The excerpt states that regulators could impose conditions that reduce the ultimate value of acquisitions.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":5,\"reason\":\"The excerpt says company investments may create volatility and fluctuations in results, generate realized and unrealized gains or losses, and result in losses up to the value of the investments.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":6,\"reason\":\"The excerpt says many investee companies may not achieve near-term profitability, or any profitability, and that there is no guarantee of a return.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":7,\"reason\":\"The excerpt describes private-company investments as including early-stage companies still defining their strategic direction, and says many invested securities are non-marketable and illiquid at initial investment.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":8,\"reason\":\"The excerpt says unsuccessful investee companies could lead NVIDIA to recognize an impairment and/or lose all or part of its investment.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":9,\"reason\":\"The excerpt states that the investment portfolio has industry-sector concentration risks and that declines in one or more sectors could increase impairment losses.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":10,\"reason\":\"The excerpt lists diversion of capital and management attention, difficulty realizing a satisfactory return, approval or financing difficulties, deal-related legal proceedings, and due-diligence failures to identify significant issues.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":11,\"reason\":\"The cited excerpts list integration difficulties involving technology, systems and operations and key personnel, assumed liabilities, amortization and impairment or write-down charges, and integration of accounting, forecasting and controls.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":12,\"reason\":\"The excerpt lists each stated risk, including regulatory or closing-related impacts, debt and interest expense and covenant compliance, dilutive equity issuance, variable performance-based consideration, economic changes, cybersecurity risks, and impaired relationships or loss of employees, vendors and customers.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":13,\"reason\":\"The excerpt says NVIDIA has experienced lengthy and costly systems integration and purchasing and shipping delays, and that these challenges have impacted results and may continue to do so.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":14,\"reason\":\"The excerpt says NVIDIA is finalizing an investment and partnership agreement with OpenAI and gives no assurance that it will enter into the agreement or complete a transaction.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":15,\"reason\":\"The excerpt states that in fiscal 2026 NVIDIA invested $17.5 billion in private companies and infrastructure funds, primarily to support early-stage startups, including AI model makers that buy its products, and that many investments are illiquid and non-marketable.\",\"supported\":true},{\"sentence\":16,\"reason\":\"The excerpt states that NVIDIA provided $3.5 billion in land, power and shell guarantees to early-stage companies and may assume the underlying leases or sublease them if escrow and partners\u2019 operating activities do not cover a default.\",\"supported\":true}]}", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message", "phase": "final_answer"}], "parallel_tool_calls": true, "temperature": 1.0, "tool_choice": "auto", "tools": [], "top_p": 0.98, "background": false, "completed_at": 1792362499.0, "max_o